        <profile name="Astral Meditations" id="f5aa-7210-8d78-21d1" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is on the battlefield, you count as having witnessed 1 additional **asterism** for the purposes of friendly abilities.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Dead for Innumerable Ages" id="ce8a-f543-15c0-eea4" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">The first time this unit would be destroyed, it is not destroyed and any remaining damage points inflicted on it have no effect. Then, **Heal (12)** this unit. For the rest of the battle:
• This unit cannot use abilities other than **^^Spell^^**, **^^Unbind^^** and **^^Banish^^** abilities.
• Enemy units can ignore this unit&apos;s combat range for the purposes of movement and charging.
• Enemy units can ignore this unit for the purposes of setting up on the battlefield but cannot be set up on this unit.

Designer&apos;s Note: The effects of this unit&apos;s passive abilities would still apply. If this unit cannot be healed, this unit is destroyed instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Supreme Master of Order" id="244b-f6f2-322d-5345" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 2 to casting rolls for this unit. In addition, add 1 to casting rolls for other visible friendly **^^Seraphon Wizards^^** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Might of the Old Ones" id="00d9-68ba-7b3f-cf5d" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible friendly **^^Seraphon^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">For each **asterism** you have witnessed, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn.
***Terrifying Presence:*** Your opponent must spend an additional command point for enemy units to use a command while they are in combat with the target.
***Supreme Fortitude:*** The target has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.
***Relentless Pursuit:*** Add 1 to charge rolls for the target.
***Unwavering Vigilance:*** While the target is wholly within 6&quot; of a visible friendly **^^Slann^^**, add 3&quot; to the distance the target can move when making pile-in moves.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
