        <profile name="Battle Damaged" id="fa62-d893-f4fe-2fd5" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Stegadon&apos;s Horns and Feet** is 4.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Cosmic Engine" id="69ed-2417-8e40-5d51" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">For each of the following **asterisms** you have witnessed, apply the corresponding effect to friendly **^^Seraphon^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit:
***Coils of Sotek:*** Add 3 to the control scores of those units.
***Rays of Chotec:*** Add 1 to run rolls for those units.
***Jaws of Itzl:*** Add 1 to wound rolls for combat attacks made by those units while they have not charged in the same turn.
***Eye of Tepok:*** Add 1 to unbinding rolls for those units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Starlight Summons" id="02a4-dfb7-e8e0-6f26" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Rallying</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 visible friendly **^^Seraphon Priests^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove any number of ritual points from the targets and give them to this unit. This unit can have a maximum of 6 ritual points.

Then, pick a friendly **^^Seraphon^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and return a number of slain models to it with a combined Health characteristic of up to the number of ritual points this unit has. Then, remove a number of ritual points from this unit equal to the combined Health characteristic of the models returned by this ability.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
