          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is wholly within the combat range of a friendly **^^Seraphon Monster^^**, that **^^Monster^^** has **^^Ward (5+)^^**. However, each time you make a successful ward roll for that **^^Monster^^** while any friendly **Terrawing** units are wholly within its combat range, allocate 1 damage point to 1 of those **Terrawing** units after the damage sequence for the **^^Monster^^** has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
