            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each model in this unit that is within 3&quot; of the target. Add 1 to each roll if the target is **^^Infantry^^**. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
