            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">You can only use this ability if you have witnessed 4 or more **asterisms**. Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Seraphon^^** units that are not in combat to be the targets.</characteristic>
