            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that was targeted by all of this unit&apos;s shooting attacks this phase. Then, pick a friendly **Raptadon Chargers** unit in combat with that enemy unit to be the target of this ability.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target can immediately use the &apos;Retreat&apos; ability as if it were your movement phase and no mortal damage is inflicted on it when it does so. In addition, the target can still use **^^Charge^^** abilities this turn even though it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
