            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">After that ability has been resolved, pick an enemy unit this unit passed across as part of that ability to be the target.

Roll a dice. Add 2 to the roll if this unit is within the combat range of any friendly **Terradon Riders** units. On a 5+:
• Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.
• If any damage points are allocated by this ability this turn and the target does not have **^^Fly^^**, the target cannot use **^^Run^^** abilities until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
