            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made with this unit&apos;s **Companion** weapons while any enemy units have been destroyed this turn.</characteristic>
