            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">After that ability has been resolved, pick up to 3 other visible friendly **^^Seraphon^^** units that are in combat and wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.

For each target:
• You can make a pile-in move.
• Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with that target and roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that enemy unit equal to the roll.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic>
