            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit&apos;s **Sotek&apos;s Venomites** is a token. If this unit&apos;s **Sotek&apos;s Venomites** is on the battlefield, roll a D3. On a 1, remove this unit&apos;s **Sotek&apos;s Venomites** from the battlefield. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic>
