            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a battle round. At the start of that battle round, set your and your opponent&apos;s **fury levels** to 7. Then, at the start of the battle round after the one you picked, set your and your opponent&apos;s **fury levels** to 1</characteristic>
